<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About | Coffee, Cats, and Thoughts</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #f7f2e9;
      color: #332b27;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 48px 20px 30px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #d9cfc2;
    }

    .journal-label,
    .section-label {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9a6648;
    }

    .journal-label {
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .section-label {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      font-size: 52px;
      font-weight: normal;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

.site-title a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
  display: inline-block;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  cursor: pointer;
}

    nav {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #d9cfc2;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #332b27;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 18px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #9a6648;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 60px 20px 90px;
    }

    .intro {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .intro h2 {
      font-size: 54px;
      font-weight: normal;
      margin: 18px 0 12px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .subhead {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #795f50;
      font-style: italic;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .about-copy {
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .about-copy p {
      margin: 0 0 1.5em;
    }

    .closing {
      margin-top: 45px;
      padding-top: 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid #d9cfc2;
      font-style: italic;
      color: #795f50;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #d9cfc2;
      padding: 35px 20px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #8a7061;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      header h1 {
        font-size: 40px;
      }

      .intro h2 {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

      nav a {
        margin: 0 7px;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

          .about-copy {
        font-size: 18px;
    }

    .about-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 30px;
    }

    .about-photo {
        max-width: 320px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
}
.about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr;
    gap: 50px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 35px;
}

.about-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 4px;
}
  </style>
</head>

<body>

 {% include "site-header.njk" %}

<main>

  <section class="intro">
    <div class="section-label">A little about me</div>
    <h2>Hi, I’m J.</h2>
    <p class="subhead">The person behind the coffee, cats, and thoughts.</p>
  </section>
<section class="about-layout">

  <div class="about-photo">
    <img src="/images/about-j.jpg" alt="J with her cat">
  </div>

  <div class="about-copy">

    <p>
      I’m a wife, mom of two, cat servant, and freelance writer.
    </p>

    <p>
      I started this site as a home for the stories, reflections, and 3 a.m. thoughts
      that don’t always fit neatly into a social media post. Some are about family and
      parenting. Others wander into books, faith, school, growing older, memories, and
      trying to make sense of the world around us.
    </p>

    <p>
      When I’m not working on a writing project or attending school activities, you’ll
      probably find me spending time with my family, reading a book, or being supervised
      by an unreasonable number of cats.
    </p>

    <p>
      Mostly, this is just a collection of stories and observations from a mom who’s
      learning as she goes, overthinking more than necessary, and writing about it along
      the way.
    </p>

    <p class="closing">
      Thanks for stopping by. I hope you find something here that makes you smile,
      think, remember, or feel a little less alone.
    </p>
 </div>
  </section>

</main>

{% include "site-footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
